---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactAction from '../components/ContactAction.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---
<Layout>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero-shell">
  <div class="container hero">
    <div class="hero-kicker"><span>FOUNDER-LED. ONTARIO-FOCUSED.</span><span class="hero-location">CANADIAN TECHNOLOGY INCUBATION</span></div>
    <h1>Build a business around<br />a problem <em>worth solving.</em></h1>
    <div class="hero-bottom">
      <div class="hero-intro"><p>Practical mentorship, customer validation, and product execution for early-stage Canadian technology founders.</p><div class="actions"><ContactAction label="Express Interest" subject="Founder interest — FoundNexa" /><a class="text-link" href="#program">Explore the program <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></div>{!site.email && <p class="contact-note">Contact details are being finalized. Please check back.</p>}</div>
      <div class="hero-program"><span class="status"><span></span>{site.status}</span><div class="program-facts"><div><strong>12 weeks</strong><span>Structured incubation</span></div><div><strong>One venture.</strong><span>Focused milestones.</span></div></div><a href="#about" class="hero-scroll">Discover our approach <span aria-hidden="true">&#8595;</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <svg class="hero-lines" viewBox="0 0 580 500" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M120 500V220C120 99 218 1 339 1h220M165 500V220c0-96 78-174 174-174h220M210 500V220c0-71 58-129 129-129h220M255 500V220c0-46 38-84 84-84h220M300 500V220c0-21 18-39 39-39h220" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="339" cy="181" r="5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="intro-strip"><div class="container"><span>Rooted in Ontario. Built for founders.</span><span>B2B SOFTWARE <i>·</i> SAAS <i>·</i> AI-ENABLED VENTURES <i>·</i> TECHNOLOGY SERVICES</span></div></div>
<section id="about" class="section container about"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our conviction</span><h2>Good businesses start<br />with better questions.</h2></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="lead">What problem matters enough to solve? Who needs it solved? And what would make the business work?</p><p>FoundNexa is developing a founder-led incubator based in the Greater Toronto Area, serving early-stage technology founders across Ontario. Our mission is to help Canadian founders turn meaningful customer problems into validated, sustainable businesses.</p><p>We bring customer understanding, commercial judgment, and product execution into the same conversation—with focused support and clear venture milestones.</p><a href="#program" class="text-link">A practical path forward <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></section>
<section class="fit-section"><div class="container fit-layout"><div><span class="eyebrow">Who we support</span><h2>Early in the journey.<br />Serious about the work.</h2><p>You don’t need all the answers. You do need a meaningful problem and the commitment to investigate it.</p></div><div class="fit-list"><div><span>01</span><p>Canadian technology founders building B2B software, SaaS, AI-enabled ventures, or technology services.</p></div><div><span>02</span><p>Teams with relevant domain knowledge and a clear customer problem to explore.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p>Founders ready to own customer research, sales, and product decisions.</p></div><p class="small">Selection will consider commitment, customer evidence, technical feasibility, and program fit. Early validation is valuable; existing revenue is not required.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="program" class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">The incubation program</span><h2>Twelve weeks.<br />A clearer way forward.</h2></div><p>A structured journey from assumptions to evidence, with hands-on mentorship and milestones that keep the work focused.</p></div><ol class="timeline">{site.stages.map(([number, weeks, title, description]) => <li><span class="timeline-number">{number}</span><span class="weeks">{weeks}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></div><span class="stage-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></li>)}</ol><div class="program-note"><h3>Clear expectations from the start.</h3><div><p>The intended outputs are stronger customer evidence, a focused product direction, and a practical next-stage plan. Revenue, investment, introductions, and product success are not guaranteed.</p><p>Participation may involve negotiated minority equity. Scope and terms will be documented in a separate agreement and disclosed before joining.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="services" class="services-section"><div class="container section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Product & software services</span><h2>Make the next step<br />something tangible.</h2></div><p>For founders and businesses that need help turning a product direction into a working solution.</p></div><div class="service-list">{site.services.map(([title, description], index) => <article><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">{['⌁', '◇', '⊞', '↗'][index]}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></article>)}</div><div class="service-bottom"><p><strong>Optional. Separately scoped. Your choice.</strong><br />Services are separately priced and contracted, and available to businesses outside the incubator. Participants can decline without losing program support and are free to use other providers.</p><ContactAction label="Discuss Your Project" subject="Development project — FoundNexa" secondary /></div>{!site.email && <p class="contact-note">Project enquiries will be available once our contact channel is confirmed.</p>}</div></section>
<section id="partners" class="section container partners"><div><span class="eyebrow">An ecosystem in the making</span><h2>Better together.<br /><em>Built on contribution.</em></h2></div><div><p class="lead">Experience is valuable. Sharing it can move a founder forward.</p><p>We welcome conversations with experienced operators, technical specialists, professional advisors, educational institutions, sponsors, and workspace providers.</p><p>Possible contributions include mentoring, practical workshops, referrals, and founder resources. We’re exploring these relationships as we prepare for launch.</p><ContactAction label="Discuss a Partnership" subject="Partnership conversation — FoundNexa" />{!site.email && <p class="contact-note">Partnership contact details are coming soon.</p>}</div></section>
<section class="measurement"><div class="container section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our measurement priorities</span><h2>Evidence over noise.</h2></div><p>These are the measurement priorities we intend to use—not a record of past results.</p></div><div class="priority-list">{site.priorities.map(([title, description], index) => <div><span>0{index + 1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section id="faq" class="section container faq"><div><span class="eyebrow">Frequently asked questions</span><h2>Before you<br />take the next step.</h2><p>Clarity matters from the beginning.</p></div><div class="faq-list">{site.faqs.map(([question, answer]) => <details><summary>{question}<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact-section"><div class="container section"><span class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</span><div class="contact-heading"><h2>What are you<br /><em>working on?</em></h2><p>Whether you’re exploring a venture, planning a product, or looking to contribute, there’s a place to start.<br /><span>{site.location}</span></p></div><div class="contact-paths"><div><h3>I’m building a venture</h3><p>Explore future incubation participation.</p><ContactAction label="Express Interest" subject="Founder interest — FoundNexa" /></div><div><h3>I have a product in mind</h3><p>Discuss a software or development project.</p><ContactAction label="Discuss Your Project" subject="Development project — FoundNexa" /></div><div><h3>I’d like to contribute</h3><p>Explore mentorship or a partnership.</p><ContactAction label="Discuss a Partnership" subject="Partnership conversation — FoundNexa" /></div></div>{!site.email ? <p class="contact-unavailable"><span aria-hidden="true">◌</span> We’re preparing for launch. Contact details are being finalized; email actions are currently unavailable. Please check back.</p> : <p class="contact-unavailable">You can also email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>}</div></section>
</main>
</Layout>
